    given-names: Eldad
repository-code: "https://github.com/etsabary/visual-decision-benchmark"
url: "https://github.com/etsabary/visual-decision-benchmark"
version: "2026-10-20-native-images-v1"
date-released: 2026-10-20
abstract: "Fourteen completed specialized decision-model runs on the same 200 image-grounded multiple-choice questions. Twelve new runs and two unchanged October15 runs are ranked; Span-02 exceeded the prespecified two-second median speed cutoff and ScaleDown rejected image input. Accuracy, coverage, timing, costs, named ability profiles, original LLM references and route exclusions are retained. The public release includes221 of227 tested image files; six charts remain referenced pending third-party terms review. The gold key remains external."
